  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.5:\n- A window with OpenMaui's own title bar (Wayland, GNOME) showed no sign it could be resized\n- Resizing a window with a complex page was slow\n- An idle window kept drawing whole frames while a hidden view animated\n- Syncfusion chips and buttons redrew themselves every frame\n- A crash (SIGSEGV in memcpy) when images were evicted from the image cache\n- `OPENMAUI_TRACE_INVALIDATE=1` printed nothing from a release package\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
